{
  "title": "Jagged Molten Saudi Arabian Lamb Kebabs",
  "description": "Spicy and flavorful lamb kebabs grilled to perfection on a robata grill, served with a side of melted grana padano cheese, this dish is a quick fix for a delicious Saudi Arabian meal. It is whole30 friendly and cooked on a slate tile vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Saudi Arabian",
