      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Thread the lamb cubes onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "In a bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the lamb cubes.",
    "Grill the lamb kebabs for 10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Place the shaved grana padano cheese on the slate tile vessel and melt under the broiler for 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the lamb kebabs on top of the melted cheese.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve immediately."
  ],
